OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze in
OL,4,Aderelict building
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have tackled a blaze in a
OL,7,Fderelict building in Swinton.
OL,9,FCrews were called to Station Street
OL,10,Fjust after 16:00 BST on Sunday, South
OL,11,FYorkshire Fire and Rescue Service said.
OL,13,FThe fire appeared to have caused
OL,14,Fsignificant damage to a building at the
OL,15,Frear of the Swinton Working Men's Club.
OL,17,FA fire service spokesperson said: "We
OL,18,Fare asking the public to stay away from
OL,19,Fthe area and for those living nearby to
OL,20,Fkeep their doors and windows closed due
OL,21,Fto smoke in the area."
